sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 participant Agent as AI / MCP Client
 participant Gateway as Enterprise MCP Gateway
 participant Adapter as Legacy MQ Adapter
 participant MQ as IBM MQ
 participant Legacy as Legacy Payment System
 Agent->>Gateway: get_payment_status(REF123)
 Gateway->>Adapter: Authorized lookup + correlation ID
 Adapter->>MQ: Put read-only query with ReplyTo and TTL
 MQ->>Legacy: Deliver to approved consumer
 Legacy->>Legacy: Read-only status lookup
 Legacy-->>MQ: Reply with status and source event ID
 MQ-->>Adapter: Matching reply before deadline
 Adapter->>Adapter: Validate IDs, recency, mask sensitive data
 Adapter-->>Gateway: Canonical status or explicit unavailable
 Gateway-->>Agent: Provenance-backed result